  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Arbetsmarknad</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labour Sector Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att utveckla riktlinjer f&#xf6;r arbetsmarknaden anpassade till de r&#xe5;dande f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna i Armenien . Lokal part &#xe4;r Ministry of Social Security. Svensk part &#xe4;r Arbetsmarknadsstyrelsen. Total kostnad f&#xf6;r projektet under 1999-2000 &#xe4;r 4 900 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at developing labour market policies appropriate for Armenian circumstances and responsive to the demands and needs of the labour market. Counterparts are the Ministry of Social Security of Armenia and the Swedish National Labour Market Board. The total amount for the project period 1999-2000 is 4 900 000 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
